   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "PRO - LARGE and SMALL datasets from PDB-REDO with cluster-based splits",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "X-ray structures with 50-500 residues. LARGE: resolution 3.0 Å or better and R-free 0.20 or lower (67,272). SMALL: 2.0 Å or better and R-free 0.25 or lower (22,318). Clustered with MMseqs2 and Foldseek, and whole clusters assigned to splits."
   },
   "creator": "wf:creator",
