   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "PRO - HDBSCAN clustering of deposited waters to define consensus sites",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Align structures, cluster all deposited waters with HDBSCAN (hyperparameters ranked by DBCV and stability), and call clusters consensus when at least 30% of structures have a water within 1.0 Å."
   },
   "creator": "wf:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Srivastava et al. 2026, doi:10.64898/2026.08.26.747373. Results: Crystallographic Water Placement Pareto Front, paragraph 2; Figure 2A",
