   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "PRO - Decoy null comparison of density at novel waters",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "For each novel water, up to eight decoys are sampled on a 2.5 Å sphere around it, dropping any that overlap non-water heavy atoms. Density at novel waters and decoys is compared in 2mFo-DFc and mFo-DFc maps."
   },
   "creator": "wf:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Srivastava et al. 2026, doi:10.64898/2026.08.26.747373. Results: Evaluating Water Prediction on Experimental Data, paragraph 3"
  },
  {
