   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "PRO - phenix refinement with predicted waters and water picking off",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Predicted waters start at B = 32.5 Å², the mean deposited water B-factor. Refinement runs with only water B-factors free, then with all coordinates, occupancies and B-factors, so no waters can be added or removed."
   },
   "creator": "wf:creator",
   "bibliographicCitation": "Srivastava et al. 2026, doi:10.64898/2026.08.26.747373. Results: Evaluating Water Prediction on Experimental Data, paragraphs 5-6",
   "references": [
    "https://doi.org/10.1107/S0907444912001308"
   ]
  },
