   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "REQ - Add more distinct, high-quality structures to the training data",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "The authors name structural diversity of high-quality data as the most likely route to better water prediction."
   },
